<title>QATAR: Qatar will mark Moslem's Ramadan on Friday.</title>
<headline>Qatar will mark Moslem's Ramadan on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatar said on Wednesday it will mark the start of the Moslem fasting month of Ramadan on Friday, the state-run news agency said.</p>
<p>In most Islamic states the month during which believers fast during daylight hours starts on the day after the new moon is sighted in each country.</p>
